erpretive Dance?</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-gWDM4X4xUQ\" data-code=\"-gWDM4X4xUQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/-gWDM4X4xUQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T01:01:08-07:00","id":1209941,"title":"","content":"A mute person buying charms that require speech to work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T01:40:27-07:00","id":1209946,"title":"","content":"The greatest artist in Creation.<br /> But (and this is the key), she has no interest in using this art to comment on contemporary political/cultural events, inspiring people, etc.<br /> <br /> Literally all she wants to do is paint the most technically excellent landscapes in Creation. She might well travel around to see unusual landscapes... but she doesn't do anything at all to effect the world. That'd detract from her devotion to her art.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":16}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T04:07:58-07:00","id":1209975,"title":"","content":"A Solar who's a pro at Survival and can turn any animal into a devourer of worlds given enough time and bonding.<br /> ... they'd much rather stay in the comfort and luxury of the city, and are way too dignified and proud of their own combat skills to have a familiar fight alongside, or for them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T05:41:26-07:00","id":1209986,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1209946#post1209946\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The greatest artist in Creation.<br /> But (and this is the key), she has no interest in using this art to comment on contemporary political/cultural events, inspiring people, etc.<br /> <br /> Literally all she wants to do is paint the most technically excellent landscapes in Creation. She might well travel around to see unusual landscapes... but she doesn't do anything at all to effect the world. That'd detract from her devotion to her art.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty sure such a person would not receive a solar exaltation. In 2e at least I think the Exaltations sought out people who wanted to use their powers to change the world. I don't know if 3e has stated anything on that front, but I doubt Sol would choose someone apathetic to creation and its fortunes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T06:38:36-07:00","id":1210008,"title":"","content":"These solars where people who stating besides the intended targets of exaltation but due to the intervention of a God it missed the mark. But this God didn't intend to intervene its mere presence was the reason everything went wrong. This is the God of terrible divine luck and bad divine fate, because of this the exaltation missed their intended targets and these unluckly heroes instead exalted.<br /> <br /> Pacific Dawn who fears confrontation / Useful talent - great at winning board games.<br /> Introvert eclipse who can't talk to women / Useful talent - great at writing stories From women's point of views.<br /> Twilight who second guesses themselves on anything they do / Useful talent - the best at finding flaws in historical actions of heroes<br /> Zenith who thinks there is no point to life anymore / Useful talent - can ruin any mood with depression<br /> Night who scared of the dark and he/she can't stand to be alone / Useful talent - Master button crafter","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T10:23:53-07:00","id":1210088,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rahod</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210008#post1210008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pacific Dawn who fears confrontation / Useful talent - great at winning board games.</div> </div> </div> </div>But there's the player of games...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T12:24:50-07:00","id":1210119,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flinty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1209986#post1209986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Pretty sure such a person would not receive a solar exaltation. In 2e at least I think the Exaltations sought out people who wanted to use their powers to change the world. I don't know if 3e has stated anything on that front, but I doubt Sol would choose someone apathetic to creation and its fortunes.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is not the case in third edition. Essence Fever does nudge you towards doing things and spending essence, but Da Vinci would undoubtedly be a Solar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/513-gatts","name":"Gatts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar513_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T12:42:43-07:00","id":1210125,"title":"","content":"I am the Iron Poppy. I brew only the finest drugs from my personal stock of purebred sources. This would be an excellent way to make money except that I am far, far too busy using my own drugs to make more than one dose at a time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5771-krata-lightblade","name":"Krata Lightblade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5771_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T18:48:28-07:00","id":1210217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krata Lightblade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210125#post1210125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am the Iron Poppy. I brew only the finest drugs from my personal stock of purebred sources. This would be an excellent way to make money except that I am far, far too busy using my own drugs to make more than one dose at a time.</div> </div> </div> </div>You might think this exalted is useless but that's like, just your opinion man","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23635-lion-hamster","name":"Lion Hamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T06:08:51-07:00","id":1210381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gatts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210119#post1210119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is not the case in third edition. Essence Fever does nudge you towards doing things and spending essence, but Da Vinci would undoubtedly be a Solar.</div> </div> </div> </div>Da Vinci also did stuff that advanced the world. I doubt Sol would choose someone who specifically dedicates herself to perfection in an area that will have no influence whatsoever on the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T06:23:32-07:00","id":1210385,"title":"","content":"Twilight Basket-Weaver, Bender of Straw. I mean, sure, they can make a REALLY nice basket, but it's still a basket.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T07:54:33-07:00","id":1210416,"title":"","content":"Awareness supernal with heavy investment in integrity. Sits atop a mountain meditating and observing the world from a distance. Sure he can hear and smell you fart from across Creation, but he isn't going to do anything about it. His quest is enlightenment and observing the world in a detached manner as he does is a critical part of his meditations.<br /> <br /> I actually considered playing that character until I realised how little the character would end up doing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T08:06:50-07:00","id":1210420,"title":"","content":"Yeah, but what about when he <i>finds</i> enlightenment, and has to go out and share it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T08:09:05-07:00","id":1210421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210385#post1210385\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Twilight Basket-Weaver, Bender of Straw. I mean, sure, they can make a REALLY nice basket, but it's still a basket.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> But Lo! it is the God-Basket! the Basket by which all others are measured. People weep to know they will never carry their assorted things in so sublime a vessel. At the same time, they refuse to use the God-Basket itself for what assorted junk is worthy of being placed inside it?<br /> <br /> ...which kinda proves your point, doesn't it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Life before Death, Strength before Weakness, Journey before Destination.&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will protect those who cannot protect themselves&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4172-marros56","name":"Marros56","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4172_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T10:08:37-07:00","id":1210472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flinty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210381#post1210381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Da Vinci also did stuff that advanced the world. I doubt Sol would choose someone who specifically dedicates herself to perfection in an area that will have no influence whatsoever on the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is no area that does not influence the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/513-gatts","name":"Gatts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar513_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T10:35:21-07:00","id":1210484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gatts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210472#post1210472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is no area that does not influence the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let's say you're a hermit who'se only ambition it is to attain enlightenment in a cave you are meditating and even when you achieve it you want to never ever leave and not share your wisdom with anyone. Does that sound like a person the Unconquered Sun would exalt, perhaps accompanied by the message of &quot;I like what you're doing, don't ever change!&quot;<br /> <br /> The hermit then proceeding to sit in his cave for the next 3000 years in silent contemplation, refusing to acknowledge the outside world as Sols foremost Zenith?<br /> <br /> It was that kind of character that I was originally responding too, someone who specifically would not use his exalted prowess to change everything but would rather sit around doing nothing of note and minding their own buisness. I personally just don't think Sol feels he needs such people to be his champions in the world.<br /> <br /> If its all just a prelude to some awesome adventure, sure. But that wasn't the point here and even then I think Sol would hand out his exaltation as it becomes relevant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T12:12:37-07:00","id":1210532,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flinty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210484#post1210484\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Let's say you're a hermit who'se only ambition it is to attain enlightenment in a cave you are meditating and even when you achieve it you want to never ever leave and not share your wisdom with anyone. Does that sound like a person the Unconquered Sun would exalt, perhaps accompanied by the message of &quot;I like what you're doing, don't ever change!&quot;<br /> <br /> The hermit then proceeding to sit in his cave for the next 3000 years in silent contemplation, refusing to acknowledge the outside world as Sols foremost Zenith?<br /> <br /> It was that kind of character that I was originally responding too, someone who specifically would not use his exalted prowess to change everything but would rather sit around doing nothing of note and minding their own buisness. I personally just don't think Sol feels he needs such people to be his champions in the world.<br /> <br /> If its all just a prelude to some awesome adventure, sure. But that wasn't the point here and even then I think Sol would hand out his exaltation as it becomes relevant.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would actually make an amazing NPC for the players to encounter, perhaps seeking wisdom.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/513-gatts","name":"Gatts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar513_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T15:45:44-07:00","id":1210651,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flinty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210484#post1210484\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If its all just a prelude to some awesome adventure, sure. But that wasn't the point here and even then I think Sol would hand out his exaltation as it becomes relevant.</div> </div> </div> </div>From my understanding Sol has no real choice about who he exalts, otherwise Sol &quot;&quot;Hasallthesocializecharms&quot; Invictus wouldn't exalt any evil solars","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23635-lion-hamster","name":"Lion Hamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T16:45:00-07:00","id":1210680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lion Hamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210651#post1210651\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> From my understanding Sol has no real choice about who he exalts, otherwise Sol &quot;&quot;Hasallthesocializecharms&quot; Invictus wouldn't exalt any evil solars</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on the edition. 2nd the exaltations were autonomous with the idea that Sol is able to choose an individual if he were so inclined, but otherwise the exaltations will pick their own host without his input. 3rd edition Sol does all the picking, but he doesn't have the option to not make more chosen and if he doesn't do it consciously he'll likely end up doing it subconsciously. <br /> As for picking evil people, he doesn't necessarily go for evil people, but its not like he won't occasionally pick individuals who aren't paragons of morality, for whatever reason he's doing it that time, and sometimes that'll pay off better than others.<br /> <br /> Course there's also incidents like Mirror Flag where good is hampered by a failing in their thought process which is possibly a sign of mental illness, Lyta who kind of just go right off the deep end, or Havash who decide to use their power entirely for entirely self serving purposes. <br /> <br /> For a more on topic point, do we a Lore supernal who refuses to use their lore skill for purposes that aren't writing porn without plot fanficiton?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T17:41:27-07:00","id":1210700,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210680#post1210680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depends on the edition. 2nd the exaltations were autonomous with the idea that Sol is able to choose an individual if he were so inclined, but otherwise the exaltations will pick their own host without his input. 3rd edition Sol does all the picking, but he doesn't have the option to not make more chosen and if he doesn't do it consciously he'll likely end up doing it subconsciously. <br /> As for picking evil people, he doesn't necessarily go for evil people, but its not like he won't occasionally pick individuals who aren't paragons of morality, for whatever reason he's doing it that time, and sometimes that'll pay off better than others.<br /> <br /> Course there's also incidents like Mirror Flag where good is hampered by a failing in their thought process which is possibly a sign of mental illness, Lyta who kind of just go right off the deep end, or Havash who decide to use their power entirely for entirely self serving purposes. <br /> <br /> For a more on topic point, do we a Lore supernal who refuses to use their lore skill for purposes that aren't writing porn without plot fanficiton?</div> </div> </div> </div>Add to this that Virtues are no longer a thing in 3rd, and you have an interesting question of what motivates Sol. I would also encourage people to look at his 1st Ed incarnation for mor definition as devs have said that is the more accurate baseline to go with where it doesn\u2019t conflict with 3rds presentation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11967-saipjas","name":"Saipjas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T18:03:55-07:00","id":1210709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210680#post1210680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For a more on topic point, do we a Lore supernal who refuses to use their lore skill for purposes that aren't writing porn without plot fanficiton?</div> </div> </div> </div> Sounds like Linguistics supernal to me, but maybe I'm missing something. Though, if you took Wyld Shaping Lore does a whole different kind of thing.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T18:11:37-07:00","id":1210715,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210709#post1210709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Sounds like Linguistics supernal to me, but maybe I'm missing something. Though, if you took Wyld Shaping Lore does a whole different kind of thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah got lore and linguistics a bit mixed up on which actually covers writing. Though now I am picturing a solar who learns the art of Wyld Shaping solely to use it for the creation of dirty novels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T18:21:36-07:00","id":1210720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lion Hamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210651#post1210651\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> From my understanding Sol has no real choice about who he exalts, otherwise Sol &quot;&quot;Hasallthesocializecharms&quot; Invictus wouldn't exalt any evil solars</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 3rd Edition leans into Solars being CHOSEN of the Unconquered Sun. Exaltations are automated seeker-missles anymore. His decisions though can be somewhat ineffible, and he isn't given to explain himself to others often. I'd generally say he's unlikely to Exalt someone who is &quot;enemy of Creation&quot; evil - but he respects Alexandrian/Genghis Khan conquerers, and Sisyphian epic tricksters, as much as he does epic peacemakers and pillars of temperance.<br /> <br /> Also people are complicated - someone could be Exalted for some awesome deed, and then react to their newfound powers with corrupt abandon - as I recall that's more or less what happened with Havesh.<br /> <br /> If you go by the Unconquered Sun's Glories of the Most High interpretation (which isn't 3E canon, but I still like), he only has those super-socialize senses you're referencing when he's upholding the strict principles of his compassion (which can still be how his Charms work even though Compassion isn't a stat anymore). If he's forsaken some principle of his compassion for other virtues at the time (because the parameters conflict), such as when he's being guided by temperate restraint, or ruthless conviction in protecting Creation as a whole - he doesn't automatically read people infallibly as when he's upholding caring about individuals as his guiding virtue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T21:16:00-07:00","id":1210796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210680#post1210680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For a more on topic point, do we a Lore supernal who refuses to use their lore skill for purposes that aren't writing porn without plot fanficiton?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that'd be linguistics?<br /> Not sure though","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23635-lion-hamster","name":"Lion Hamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T21:18:06-07:00","id":1210799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209929-creations-got-no-particularly-useful-talent?p=1210715#post1210715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah got lore and linguistics a bit mixed up on which actually covers writing. Though now I am picturing a solar who learns the art of Wyld Shaping solely to use it for the creation of dirty novels.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wyld shaping huge, dick shaped mountains into place (And hoping there are no Raksha with assumption of wyld tainted land (Hue hue, taint))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23635,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23635-lion-hamster","user":"Lion Hamster","date":". 04-24-2018, 12:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23635-lion-hamster","name":"Lion Hamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T04:51:31-07:00","id":1210899,"title":"","content":"Slightly off topic but I recall having a conversation concerning 2e rules in which an Alchemical using Piston-Driven Megaton Hammer to have sex with a Jadeborn using some of their own chams, to produce an infinite mote reactor. Seems like a fitting pair to hang out with the Useless Circle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}